  "displayName": "和会 — Mutual Aid",
  "displayNameJa": "和会",
  "displayNameEn": "Wakai",
  "description": "Non-profit religious-corp mutual aid substrate. NOT insurance (no premium-as-contract; no actuarial pricing; no claim adjudication; no policy denial). Member-to-member solidarity pooling per Charter §1.7 反個人主義 + 多世代. Pool in USDC on Base L2 stable-asset only. NO commercial insurance software (G4: Guidewire/Duck Creek/Insurity/Sapiens/Majesco/SAP Insurance/Oracle Insurance/Lemonade/Hippo PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c)). NO commercial re-insurance (G5: Munich Re/Swiss Re/SCOR/Hannover Re PROHIBITED). NO investment return promise (G6: Charter Rider §2(b) speculative finance). NO pre-existing condition discrimination (G7). Voluntary ability-scaled contribution (G8). Community discernment distribution (G9: Council Lv6+ ≥3 + ≥3 community attestation). Public Fund backstop (G10). NO payroll (G11). 6 cells / 5 Lexicons / 12 gates / 12 non-goals.",
  "descriptionJa": "非営利 religious-corp の相互扶助 substrate。保険ではない (保険料契約なし; 数理的価格設定なし; 給付査定なし; 拒絶不能)。会員相互の連帯プール per Charter §1.7 反個人主義 + 多世代。プールは USDC on Base L2 安定資産のみ。商業保険ソフト禁止 (G4: Guidewire/Duck Creek/Insurity/Sapiens/Majesco/SAP Insurance/Oracle Insurance/Lemonade/Hippo PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c))。商業再保険禁止 (G5: Munich Re/Swiss Re/SCOR/Hannover Re PROHIBITED)。投資リターン約束なし (G6: Charter Rider §2(b) 投機金融禁止)。既往症差別禁止 (G7)。任意かつ能力に応じた拠出 (G8)。コミュニティ識別分配 (G9: Council Lv6+ ≥3 + 地域証人 ≥3)。公的資金バックストップ (G10)。給与なし (G11)。",
  "adr": {
    "master": "etzhayyim:adr:2605263500",
    "parent": "etzhayyim:adr:2605192145",
    "r0": "etzhayyim:adr:2605263500",
    "r1": "reserved",
    "r2": "reserved",
    "r3": "reserved"
  },
  "tier": "Tier-B",
  "parentActor": null,
  "form": "任意団体 internal mutual aid substrate (NOT 一般社団 / NPO / 公益財団 / 宗教法人 法人格; NOT a state-licensed insurance entity — Preamble §0.4 Lv7+ unanimity lock)",
  "notInsuranceInvariant": "G3 STRUCTURAL: no premium-as-contract / no actuarial pricing / no claim adjudication / no policy denial / no underwriting / no investment return; member-to-member solidarity only",
  "crossActor": {
    "kazaori": "Emergency pool activation during declared emergency (kazaori path-reserved wakai cross-actor at ADR-2605263200)",
    "iyashi": "Chronic care continuity gap funding; clinical event support",
    "hagukumi": "Daily-living gap funding; multi-gen support",
    "yakushi": "Medication supply gap funding",
    "toritate": "Mutual aid pool transparency + Public Fund backstop accounting",
    "chigiri.member_onboarding": "(read) Adherent SBT verification",
    "chigiri.stewardLaborAttestation": "(read) Administrator L5 vocation-flow (G11)",
    "publicFundSafe": "(← backstop disbursement) Council Lv6+ ≥4/7 when pool insufficient",
    "titheRouter": "(read; aggregate solidarity capacity) Informs pool-balance forecasting",
    "kawase-yui": "Sibling mutual-aid actor — wakai covers in-jurisdiction health/disability/unemployment/disaster mutual aid; kawase-yui covers cross-border adherent-to-adherent multi-stable remittance (ADR-2605282200). R3 cross-actor integration enables composite flows (e.g. medical-evacuation = wakai medical event + kawase international transfer composed). Both inherit Charter §2(b) speculative-finance discipline + §1.7 反個人主義 mutual-aid framing."
  },
  "constitutionalDiscipline": {
    "notInsurance": "G3 — no premium-as-contract; no actuarial pricing; no claim adjudication; no policy denial; no underwriting",
